WEBVTT

02:02.990 --> 02:05.450
<b>Sir, we greatly appreciate
your continued patronage</b>

02:05.620 --> 02:07.370
<b>during these troubling times.</b>

02:07.540 --> 02:10.170
<b>However, I must ask...</b>

02:10.880 --> 02:13.250
<b>Are you truly okay
with always having just steak</b>

02:13.420 --> 02:15.000
<b>and nothing else?</b>

02:16.340 --> 02:18.630
<b>I require the perfect protein intake</b>

02:18.800 --> 02:21.340
<b>in order to maintain
my perfect body.</b>

02:22.430 --> 02:24.060
<b>It's as simple as that.</b>

02:25.220 --> 02:26.770
<b>I'm done.
See you tomorrow.</b>

02:27.140 --> 02:28.430
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

04:08.660 --> 04:10.370
<b>It's about time
for the inquiry committee hearing.</b>

04:10.660 --> 04:11.870
<b>Are you ready?</b>

04:12.210 --> 04:13.290
<b>Of course.</b>

04:13.500 --> 04:15.670
<b>Feeling nervous at all?</b>

04:16.710 --> 04:17.460
<b>Nope.</b>

04:18.920 --> 04:21.340
<b>It's no wonder
they call you the walking AI.</b>

04:22.380 --> 04:23.800
<b>Oh, nothing.</b>

04:24.590 --> 04:27.050
<b>Well, we better get going.</b>

04:38.360 --> 04:40.440
<b>Oh, hey, you feeling okay?</b>

04:40.730 --> 04:42.030
<b>Yeah, I'm fine...</b>

04:44.450 --> 04:45.240
<b>Ow...</b>

04:45.410 --> 04:46.740
<b>You should get more rest.</b>

04:48.490 --> 04:50.410
<b>Thanks for having my back.</b>

04:51.790 --> 04:53.250
<b>The feeling is totally mutual.</b>

04:53.910 --> 04:55.120
<b>Where's Axel?</b>

04:55.290 --> 04:57.000
<b>He's out getting groceries
with Doug.</b>

04:57.420 --> 05:00.040
<b>Huh? Has that cat always been here?</b>

05:00.210 --> 05:01.130
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:01.300 --> 05:03.460
<b>Although
it's still not very friendly.</b>

05:03.920 --> 05:07.260
<b>Found a place
to belong in spite of itself, huh?</b>

05:12.180 --> 05:14.390
<b>Alrighty, I bought a bunch of stuff.</b>

05:16.850 --> 05:18.230
<b>I've turned off the drive recorder</b>

05:18.400 --> 05:20.270
<b>so our conversation
won't be overheard.</b>

05:20.440 --> 05:21.980
<b>Oh dang, are you...</b>

05:22.650 --> 05:24.030
<b>gonna ask me out on a date?</b>

05:26.240 --> 05:29.620
<b>That's the last thing I'd do,
even if the world ended tomorrow.</b>

05:29.780 --> 05:30.780
<b>Bummer.</b>

05:31.410 --> 05:32.700
<b>What do you think?</b>

05:32.870 --> 05:33.790
<b>About what?</b>

05:33.950 --> 05:37.080
<b>Say that we get our hands
on Skinner...</b>

05:37.250 --> 05:39.580
<b>will we really get the freedom
they promised us?</b>

05:39.750 --> 05:41.000
<b>Hard to say.</b>

05:41.170 --> 05:44.090
<b>Seems like we may have uncovered
one too many secrets.</b>

05:44.260 --> 05:45.260
<b>Exactly.</b>

05:45.420 --> 05:47.430
<b>And considering
they went out of their way</b>

05:47.590 --> 05:49.590
<b>to make Lazarus
a separate unit from the NSA...</b>

05:49.760 --> 05:51.350
<b>So once the job is done,</b>

05:51.510 --> 05:54.310
<b>they'll just erase us
all along with it.</b>

05:54.520 --> 05:57.270
<b>For once, I agree with you.</b>

05:57.600 --> 05:58.640
<b>Aw, shucks.</b>

05:58.810 --> 06:01.690
<b>And I'm pretty sure
they're already tyring to figure out</b>

06:02.190 --> 06:03.650
<b>exactly how much we know.</b>

06:09.160 --> 06:10.070
<b>Hayes!</b>

06:10.620 --> 06:11.870
<b>It's been awhile.</b>

06:12.030 --> 06:13.370
<b>Hey, Abel.</b>

06:13.740 --> 06:14.870
<b>You're looking good.</b>

06:15.040 --> 06:16.160
<b>Right back at you.</b>

06:16.660 --> 06:17.910
<b>Let me introduce you.</b>

06:18.080 --> 06:19.210
<b>This is...</b>

06:21.580 --> 06:22.880
<b>Maybe later.</b>

06:24.300 --> 06:25.050
<b>Friend of yours?</b>

06:25.510 --> 06:26.880
<b>That's Captain Hayes.</b>

06:27.050 --> 06:29.180
<b>He was in the Green Berets with me.</b>

06:29.380 --> 06:30.550
<b>Wow...</b>

06:30.720 --> 06:34.680
<b>He's a career military man,
born and bred in the Army.</b>

06:35.140 --> 06:36.060
<b>And the other guy?</b>

06:36.560 --> 06:38.480
<b>That's Schneider from INSCOM.</b>

06:38.770 --> 06:41.810
<b>I don't know him personally,
but he's supposed to be quite sharp.</b>

06:42.020 --> 06:43.730
<b>Sounds like you've got a new rival.</b>

06:48.190 --> 06:51.660
<b>I now call this inquiry
committee hearing to order.</b>

06:51.950 --> 06:53.160
<b>We are gathered here today</b>

06:53.320 --> 06:57.660
<b>to discuss the future of Team S5,
also known as Lazarus,</b>

06:57.870 --> 07:00.920
<b>that was recently formed
under NSA supervision.</b>

07:01.210 --> 07:03.380
<b>Okay, please present the report.</b>

07:04.790 --> 07:07.300
<b>The Lazarus team
was specially assembled</b>

07:07.460 --> 07:08.970
<b>with the goal of capturing Skinner,</b>

07:09.720 --> 07:11.840
<b>but so far they've instigated
a public shootout,</b>

07:12.010 --> 07:13.970
<b>a helicopter crash,</b>

07:14.140 --> 07:17.350
<b>a massive fire at a cult compound,
and most recently,</b>

07:17.520 --> 07:19.350
<b>an oil rig fire in Russia,</b>

07:19.520 --> 07:22.020
<b>all of which has put them
under serious suspicion.</b>

07:22.400 --> 07:24.480
<b>We've already confirmed
the Lazarus team</b>

07:24.650 --> 07:27.230
<b>landed in close proximity
to the site of that fire</b>

07:27.400 --> 07:29.280
<b>by using a European-based
US Army copter</b>

07:29.440 --> 07:31.280
<b>just prior to its outbreak.</b>

07:31.780 --> 07:32.570
<b>It seems clear beyond a doubt</b>

07:32.780 --> 07:35.740
<b>that Lazarus was directly involved
in these incidents.</b>

07:35.910 --> 07:37.330
<b>Anything to say, Abel?</b>

07:39.160 --> 07:40.040
<b>I have no objections.</b>

07:41.160 --> 07:42.080
<b>As if that's not bad enough,</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:46.040
<b>one member of Lazarus is actually
a former Russian spy.</b>

07:46.590 --> 07:49.340
<b>You can't deny the possibility
that she might have leaked</b>

07:49.550 --> 07:51.170
<b>our intel to Russia, can you?</b>

07:51.340 --> 07:52.380
<b>The biggest problem is</b>

07:52.930 --> 07:55.470
<b>this series of actions
has no direct connection</b>

07:55.640 --> 07:57.560
<b>to their mission
of capturing Skinner.</b>

07:59.770 --> 08:00.680
<b>In that case,</b>

08:00.850 --> 08:04.270
<b>it seems to me
that we need to see proof</b>

08:04.440 --> 08:06.560
<b>of whether Lazarus is really
searching for Skinner or not.</b>

08:07.520 --> 08:08.820
<b>As it so happens,</b>

08:09.110 --> 08:12.950
<b>my people have made contact
with a member of Lazarus</b>

08:13.110 --> 08:15.780
<b>and we've arranged for them
to testify at this hearing.</b>

08:17.200 --> 08:19.040
<b>Permission is hereby granted</b>

08:19.200 --> 08:21.580
<b>to bring the witness in
and have them testify.</b>

08:27.250 --> 08:28.670
<b>Are you saying that we've got a spy?</b>

08:29.840 --> 08:30.960
<b>Well...</b>

08:31.130 --> 08:33.970
<b>I once saw Leland carrying
two different cell phones around.</b>

08:34.840 --> 08:36.390
<b>I don't have any solid proof,</b>

08:36.970 --> 08:38.550
<b>but be sure to keep that in mind.</b>

08:38.930 --> 08:40.220
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

08:40.970 --> 08:42.180
<b>Your name?</b>

08:42.350 --> 08:43.890
<b>Leland Astor, sir.</b>

08:44.190 --> 08:46.400
<b>You've been acting
as a member of Lazarus</b>

08:46.900 --> 08:50.110
<b>and monitoring all of their actions
from the inside.</b>

08:50.270 --> 08:50.940
<b>Is that right?</b>

08:51.780 --> 08:52.490
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

08:52.820 --> 08:54.950
<b>Let's start
with your mission in the Arctic.</b>

08:55.110 --> 08:59.120
<b>Was that necessary in regards
to the search for Skinner?</b>

08:59.490 --> 09:00.580
<b>No.</b>

09:00.740 --> 09:03.500
<b>That operation
was undertaken to rescue Chris,</b>

09:03.660 --> 09:06.040
<b>and it had no direct connection
to Skinner.</b>

09:06.250 --> 09:07.460
<b>Oh?</b>

09:07.630 --> 09:11.000
<b>So this mission, which has stoked
international tensions,</b>

09:11.210 --> 09:13.630
<b>was carried out solely
to rescue one of your own,</b>

09:13.840 --> 09:14.880
<b>do I have that right?</b>

09:15.300 --> 09:16.470
<b>Correct.</b>

09:19.390 --> 09:20.470
<b>Oh, Chris.</b>

09:20.640 --> 09:22.180
<b>You shouldn't be
moving around yet...</b>

09:22.350 --> 09:23.600
<b>Aw, c'mon.</b>

09:23.770 --> 09:26.350
<b>At this rate the world
will end with me still in bed!</b>

09:32.400 --> 09:34.030
<b>What was this again?</b>

09:39.450 --> 09:42.080
<b>However, Chris is an essential part</b>

09:42.240 --> 09:44.200
<b>of ensuring
that Skinner is found and captured.</b>

09:44.450 --> 09:45.330
<b>So, in other words,</b>

09:46.160 --> 09:47.540
<b>this mission
was ultimately necessary</b>

09:47.710 --> 09:49.750
<b>if we want to catch Skinner.</b>

09:50.130 --> 09:51.710
<b>Hold on, are you saying</b>

09:51.880 --> 09:54.840
<b>that it was worth the cost
of causing an international affair?</b>

09:55.010 --> 09:56.630
<b>No, but right now,</b>

09:57.170 --> 09:59.890
<b>I believe finding Skinner should be
considered the higher priority.</b>

10:00.090 --> 10:04.310
<b>Tell us, were your teammates really
searching for Skinner?</b>

10:04.720 --> 10:06.890
<b>Weren't they actually
doing something else?</b>

10:07.100 --> 10:08.060
<b>No, sir.</b>

10:08.230 --> 10:09.270
<b>From what I could tell,</b>

10:09.440 --> 10:11.440
<b>there was no indication
they were doing anything else.</b>

10:11.810 --> 10:13.650
<b>I still have questions.</b>

10:14.110 --> 10:15.650
<b>For example,</b>

10:15.820 --> 10:18.610
<b>the history of another member,
Axel Gilberto.</b>

10:18.990 --> 10:20.700
<b>We're aware
that he was in prison before,</b>

10:20.870 --> 10:22.990
<b>but the details
seemed to have been covered up.</b>

10:23.330 --> 10:24.540
<b>Well...</b>

10:25.160 --> 10:27.040
<b>I'm not sure myself,</b>

10:27.660 --> 10:28.620
<b>but my guess is</b>

10:28.790 --> 10:31.210
<b>someone from the prison
has tried to bury it,</b>

10:31.380 --> 10:33.090
<b>since they don't want people to know
that he escaped multiple times.</b>

10:33.670 --> 10:36.590
<b>So, he's broken out of prison
more than once?</b>

10:36.960 --> 10:38.260
<b>That's what he told me:</b>

10:38.800 --> 10:42.760
<b>From the icy depths of Alaska
to the heart of the Arizona desert.</b>

10:46.930 --> 10:48.770
<b>The witness may step down.</b>

10:49.520 --> 10:50.730
<b>In any case,</b>

10:50.900 --> 10:54.360
<b>our view is that the Lazarus team
must be held responsible</b>

10:54.570 --> 10:56.690
<b>for the various issues
they have caused.</b>

10:59.150 --> 10:59.990
<b>Pardon me!</b>

11:00.200 --> 11:01.700
<b>What is it?</b>

11:02.110 --> 11:05.490
<b>Skinner has just uploaded
a new video statement online!</b>

11:08.120 --> 11:10.670
<b>It's been twenty days
since I made my initial statement,</b>

11:11.420 --> 11:15.420
<b>but I'm afraid that no one
has come to visit me.</b>

11:16.090 --> 11:19.760
<b>The world's governments have been
acting as if nothing happened.</b>

11:19.920 --> 11:22.930
<b>They continue to fight over
territorial waters in the Arctic</b>

11:23.140 --> 11:27.430
<b>and just shamefully push the world
even closer to war.</b>

11:28.020 --> 11:31.730
<b>Has humanity already given up
on the idea of survival?</b>

11:32.850 --> 11:34.150
<b>As previously announced,</b>

11:34.310 --> 11:36.190
<b>the first subject
will die in ten days.</b>

11:37.070 --> 11:38.730
<b>And you should know
that first subject...</b>

11:39.190 --> 11:40.820
<b>is me.</b>

11:41.490 --> 11:44.570
<b>So unless you find and catch me
within the next ten days,</b>

11:44.780 --> 11:47.080
<b>then hope will be lost forever.</b>

11:47.240 --> 11:48.080
<b>No way...</b>

11:48.660 --> 11:50.710
<b>So he hasn't taken the antidote?</b>

11:51.080 --> 11:53.370
<b>How the world
will look after ten days</b>

11:53.540 --> 11:55.330
<b>is entirely up to you people.</b>

11:56.040 --> 11:59.000
<b>That's all I can say at this point.</b>

12:06.470 --> 12:08.350
<b>Huh? What's so funny?!</b>

12:08.930 --> 12:10.100
<b>Nothing much.</b>

12:10.270 --> 12:12.100
<b>Just that I agree with Skinner.</b>

12:12.850 --> 12:15.520
<b>Everything
that I was planning to say here,</b>

12:15.730 --> 12:16.860
<b>he already said for me.</b>

12:17.360 --> 12:18.770
<b>What do you mean?</b>

12:19.400 --> 12:22.700
<b>We don't have time to waste
on this ridiculous farce.</b>

12:23.780 --> 12:25.910
<b>What good does it do any of us</b>

12:26.070 --> 12:29.740
<b>to sabotage our colleagues
and stab them in the back?</b>

12:30.410 --> 12:31.540
<b>The bottom line is,</b>

12:31.700 --> 12:34.170
<b>we're just one step away
from catching Skinner.</b>

12:34.830 --> 12:37.040
<b>If the committee chooses
to disband Lazarus now,</b>

12:37.460 --> 12:39.550
<b>then which of you is planning
to assume responsibility</b>

12:39.710 --> 12:41.550
<b>when nobody is able
to find Skinner in time?</b>

12:42.090 --> 12:44.680
<b>Who will even be left
to take the blame</b>

12:44.840 --> 12:47.430
<b>after the world
literally comes to an end?</b>

12:50.560 --> 12:52.140
<b>Then, we have no choice.</b>

12:52.310 --> 12:53.310
<b>But, sir!</b>

12:53.930 --> 12:55.270
<b>Permission is granted for Lazarus</b>

12:55.440 --> 12:57.270
<b>to temporarily resume
their activities.</b>

12:57.610 --> 13:00.400
<b>But obviously,
only for ten more days!</b>

13:00.570 --> 13:03.320
<b>You must capture him
without fail before then.</b>

13:04.200 --> 13:05.030
<b>Of course.</b>

13:05.200 --> 13:06.740
<b>That's the plan.</b>

13:08.450 --> 13:09.490
<b>You heard the kid's testimony.</b>

13:09.660 --> 13:11.450
<b>The escapee
from Eyman Prison in Arizona</b>

13:11.620 --> 13:12.950
<b>that we've been looking for...</b>

13:13.200 --> 13:16.080
<b>is definitely Axel Gilberto.</b>

13:16.330 --> 13:17.790
<b>Then why is there no data?</b>

13:18.000 --> 13:21.380
<b>I'm assuming because
they had a hacker erase it all.</b>

13:21.750 --> 13:24.170
<b>They don't want
anybody to know, huh?</b>

13:24.720 --> 13:26.470
<b>We're going to have to take action.</b>

13:27.010 --> 13:28.720
<b>Don't underestimate Abel.</b>

13:28.890 --> 13:30.760
<b>That man is incredibly sharp.</b>

13:31.140 --> 13:33.060
<b>He'll catch on
if we act too carelessly.</b>

13:33.220 --> 13:36.770
<b>I'm aware, which is why
we won't do it ourselves.</b>

13:37.100 --> 13:38.560
<b>In fact...</b>

13:38.730 --> 13:40.690
<b>we'll just get a ghost</b>

13:40.860 --> 13:43.280
<b>that nobody has ever met
to do it instead.</b>

13:44.070 --> 13:45.440
<b>What do you mean "ghost"?</b>

13:47.240 --> 13:48.240
<b>Leland!</b>

13:49.280 --> 13:50.450
<b>There you are.</b>

13:51.580 --> 13:52.830
<b>You gave me a real scare.</b>

13:52.990 --> 13:54.750
<b>S-sorry.</b>

13:54.950 --> 13:56.000
<b>I nearly lost it</b>

13:56.160 --> 13:58.040
<b>after your testimony
started painting us in a bad light.</b>

13:58.210 --> 13:59.670
<b>I was totally ready to kill you.</b>

13:59.830 --> 14:02.340
<b>Gosh, that joke's
more scary than funny...</b>

14:02.550 --> 14:04.590
<b>Why didn't you tell me about this?</b>

14:04.760 --> 14:06.510
<b>Well, as the saying goes...</b>

14:07.510 --> 14:09.970
<b>"Fool the enemy
by fooling your friends first."</b>

14:11.300 --> 14:12.510
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:13.180 --> 14:16.810
<b>Was it INSCOM who reached out to you
about testifying, Leland?</b>

14:17.230 --> 14:20.730
<b>They never said who they were,
but I'm pretty sure it was.</b>

14:20.980 --> 14:22.860
<b>They must have thought it'd be easy
to flip you to their side,</b>

14:23.520 --> 14:27.400
<b>but apparently
they weren't aware that Abel</b>

14:27.570 --> 14:29.280
<b>was close friends
with your father, huh?</b>

14:42.380 --> 14:44.210
<b>Thank you for your business.</b>

14:45.340 --> 14:48.170
<b>Very well, I will come to you.</b>

14:59.600 --> 15:00.850
<b>Goddammit.</b>

15:01.480 --> 15:03.480
<b>Skinner being the first to die</b>

15:03.650 --> 15:04.860
<b>was definitely not
something I saw coming.</b>

15:05.020 --> 15:06.280
<b>We're boned.</b>

15:06.940 --> 15:09.070
<b>Oh, Chris, you okay to be up?</b>

15:09.400 --> 15:12.740
<b>Well, we can't really afford me
sleeping in bed all day, can we?</b>

15:12.950 --> 15:14.740
<b>Did you see Skinner's statement?</b>

15:15.120 --> 15:16.490
<b>We just watched it.</b>

15:16.700 --> 15:19.830
<b>It seems pretty obvious that Skinner
never took the antidote.</b>

15:20.250 --> 15:21.540
<b>I got the same impression.</b>

15:21.710 --> 15:24.340
<b>No more time to screw around, huh?</b>

15:24.500 --> 15:27.800
<b>Yeah, except we don't have
any new clues to go off of.</b>

15:28.300 --> 15:29.720
<b>Oh, right!</b>

15:30.300 --> 15:31.800
<b>Could you look into this for me?</b>

15:33.720 --> 15:34.850
<b>What's this?</b>

15:35.010 --> 15:36.010
<b>Some kind of drug?</b>

15:36.220 --> 15:38.850
<b>It's something I picked up
when we searched Skinner's place.</b>

15:39.020 --> 15:39.770
<b>Really?</b>

15:39.980 --> 15:41.770
<b>How come this is the first time
we're seeing it?</b>

15:41.940 --> 15:44.060
<b>Cuz I forgot about it, jeez.</b>

15:44.230 --> 15:45.690
<b>Whatever, I bet that pill
was just stuffed</b>

15:45.860 --> 15:47.360
<b>in some clothes lying on the floor.</b>

15:47.570 --> 15:49.530
<b>Whoa, how'd you know that?</b>

15:49.820 --> 15:51.700
<b>In any case, we should look into it.</b>

15:55.620 --> 15:56.990
<b>It's almost time.</b>

16:00.080 --> 16:01.160
<b>Greetings.</b>

16:01.660 --> 16:03.290
<b>I assume you're the clients?</b>

16:04.000 --> 16:05.170
<b>You're the guy?</b>

16:05.330 --> 16:06.710
<b>I'm Soryu's agent.</b>

16:06.880 --> 16:08.420
<b>Please call me HQ.</b>

16:08.840 --> 16:10.090
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

16:11.970 --> 16:15.590
<b>Sorry, but I'm afraid we can't
reveal our identities to you.</b>

16:15.760 --> 16:17.100
<b>Will that be a problem?</b>

16:17.510 --> 16:19.100
<b>Not at all.</b>

16:19.680 --> 16:21.730
<b>All that you need to provide</b>

16:21.890 --> 16:23.640
<b>is precise information
about the target and payment.</b>

16:24.230 --> 16:26.690
<b>Tell me about this "Soryu" guy.</b>

16:26.860 --> 16:28.360
<b>All I've heard
is that he's a phantom assassin</b>

16:28.520 --> 16:31.280
<b>who nobody has ever seen before.</b>

16:31.940 --> 16:34.240
<b>Who exactly is he?</b>

16:34.610 --> 16:36.620
<b>I merely act as his agent.</b>

16:37.320 --> 16:40.290
<b>I know nothing
about his origins or identity.</b>

16:40.830 --> 16:42.040
<b>Plus...</b>

16:42.410 --> 16:45.960
<b>I've actually never met him
in person myself.</b>

16:46.170 --> 16:47.170
<b>Are you serious?</b>

16:47.330 --> 16:49.550
<b>However, I can guarantee you
that any task he accepts</b>

16:49.710 --> 16:51.340
<b>will be executed flawlessly.</b>

16:52.460 --> 16:53.470
<b>All right.</b>

16:53.670 --> 16:57.470
<b>But my understanding is that
his services don't come cheap.</b>

16:57.800 --> 16:59.640
<b>It's 30 million dollars per job.</b>

16:59.890 --> 17:00.970
<b>Tax-exempt, of course.</b>

17:01.180 --> 17:01.890
<b>What?!</b>

17:02.060 --> 17:04.690
<b>Yeah, that lines up
with what I've heard.</b>

17:05.270 --> 17:07.100
<b>If you don't find
those terms acceptable,</b>

17:07.270 --> 17:09.150
<b>then we will be unable
to move forward.</b>

17:09.310 --> 17:10.320
<b>Hold on.</b>

17:10.480 --> 17:12.320
<b>I'm not paying millions of dollars</b>

17:12.480 --> 17:14.280
<b>to some ghost
that nobody has ever met</b>

17:14.450 --> 17:17.280
<b>without a guarantee
that he can get the job done.</b>

17:17.990 --> 17:19.370
<b>You propose a test?</b>

17:20.080 --> 17:21.040
<b>That's fine.</b>

17:21.200 --> 17:22.120
<b>However...</b>

17:22.290 --> 17:24.750
<b>please be aware
we don't accept responsibility</b>

17:24.910 --> 17:26.290
<b>for whatever outcome the test has.</b>

17:26.830 --> 17:28.210
<b>Fair enough.</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:32.130
<b>Then we'll proceed with payment
after the test has been completed.</b>

17:32.420 --> 17:33.670
<b>Where will the test take place?</b>

17:33.840 --> 17:34.920
<b>Check the back of my card.</b>

17:36.970 --> 17:38.840
<b>Now, if you'll please excuse me.</b>

17:59.280 --> 18:01.830
<b>Christ, all this gear
for just a single target?</b>

18:02.120 --> 18:04.160
<b>What've they got, a friggin' tank?</b>

18:04.330 --> 18:06.040
<b>Well, even you
and your piss-poor aim</b>

18:06.210 --> 18:07.330
<b>could nail 'em
with firepower like this.</b>

18:07.540 --> 18:10.790
<b>Damn straight!
They'll be mincemeat in seconds.</b>

18:11.000 --> 18:13.630
<b>Shit, guess we ain't having
sloppy joes for dinner.</b>

18:15.380 --> 18:16.510
<b>Only one target.</b>

18:16.670 --> 18:17.930
<b>Dead or alive.</b>

18:18.090 --> 18:20.470
<b>We don't know
what kind of traps to expect,</b>

18:20.640 --> 18:21.720
<b>so stay on your toes.</b>

18:22.140 --> 18:24.220
<b>This mission is complete
once we confirm</b>

18:24.390 --> 18:25.680
<b>the target has been neutralized.</b>

19:00.800 --> 19:03.720
<b>Single heat signature
detected in area 7D.</b>

19:03.930 --> 19:05.970
<b>Let's get this party started, boys!</b>

21:17.100 --> 21:17.900
<b>Come in!</b>

21:18.770 --> 21:20.230
<b>Somebody give me a sitrep!</b>

21:20.690 --> 21:23.150
<b>I repeat, somebody give me a sitrep!</b>

21:24.070 --> 21:25.820
<b>Hey! What's the matter?!</b>

21:39.960 --> 21:42.420
<b>N-no friggin' way...</b>

21:42.750 --> 21:43.630
<b>Goodness me.</b>

21:45.010 --> 21:47.010
<b>I must say,
he really went overboard.</b>

21:48.390 --> 21:51.260
<b>I will need you to dispose
of all the bodies, please.</b>

21:52.510 --> 21:53.850
<b>Hey, what happened!?</b>

21:54.430 --> 21:55.730
<b>Give me an update!</b>

22:06.030 --> 22:07.360
<b>They were wiped out?</b>

22:07.780 --> 22:08.820
<b>That's impossible...</b>

22:09.410 --> 22:12.120
<b>All right, he's passed the test.</b>

22:13.740 --> 22:15.620
<b>His target will be this man.</b>
